{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_25","type":"agent_message","text":"The scripted officer completed all three captures, including escalator travel, jumping, dashing, and loot recovery. It also exposed a pacing problem: the second crook spawned too close to the first arrest. I’m moving later crooks farther away, then checking ducking, lift travel, controllers, touch, audio output, and the Hub harness.\n"}}
