{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_35","type":"agent_message","text":"The checks found a rendering failure on the software WebGPU adapter: the device can be lost while gameplay continues. I’m simplifying the cel shader and adding renderer recovery. I also found that a very quick touch tap can end before the next frame samples it, so I’m adding a short input latch.\n"}}
