{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_67","type":"agent_message","text":"The remaining checks exposed a prompt mismatch at small stick movements: the officer moved, but the prompts still showed keyboard keys. I’m aligning those input thresholds. I’m also switching audio verification to offline-rendered samples, since sparse frame-time readings were missing short sounds, and making Credits easier to navigate with a controller.\n"}}
